  "intro": "Leatherneck Lanes offers recreational bowling, leagues, glow-bowling, private and unit party options, and much more. The center has new scoring and bumper systems, as well as new seating area décor. The 12-lane facility has a snack bar and full-service Pro Shop. Please come in for fun, food, camaraderie, and of course, bowling!",
